<title>BELGIUM: EU suggests changes to Alitalia rescue plan.</title>
<headline>EU suggests changes to Alitalia rescue plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has sent a letter to the Italian government suggesting that certain changes be made in a capital injection to state airline Alitalia SpA, a Commission spokeswoman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are analysing the dossier and in the letter we have sugggested a number of changes that could be made,&quot; spokeswoman Sarah Lambert told a news briefing. She gave no details on the changes required.</p>
<p>Italy requested EU permission last year for a capital injection of 3,313 billion lire into Alitalia.</p>
</text>
